// Article 1. Members and capital.
Fact person Identified by Iris, Jonah, Kemal
Fact company Identified by Tidewater
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Fact member Identified by person
Function capital Identified by person * int
Var total-capital Identified by int
  Derived from total-capital(Sum(Foreach capital: capital.int))
Var cash Identified by usd

Power call-capital Actor company Recipient person Related to usd
  Holds when True
  Valid when False

Clause 1.1 Approved "ce7ad9b420239251cc5a1cd80a27d6300651df7ec5cdeb3871ce8eba5b61fb8e"
  Definition "Iris Nakamura, Jonah Pratt and Kemal Aydin are the members of Tidewater Kayak LLC, the company."
Clause 1.2 Approved "628582d03d431b1636ce27d0536ff697ee5b49b79aba502f0fd3eb112174d978"
  Definition "Iris has contributed $50,000, Jonah $30,000 and Kemal $20,000."
  Norm " No member is required to contribute more." => call-capital
Clause 1.3 Approved "1795e49ebd006395c1db9ff0ee2a07cb18642ff7dae08b11c8cf7604e265952d"
  Definition "A member's percentage interest is that member's capital as a share of the capital of all the members."
.
+member(Iris). +member(Jonah). +member(Kemal).
+capital(Iris, 50000). +capital(Jonah, 30000). +capital(Kemal, 20000).
